 from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 29% of normal in March to April and 168% in July to August. Grid 24428 had its driest year in 1974 at 54%.</p>"}
